1. PRODUCT IDENTITY AND POSITIONING
==================================================

Product name: ProofPay

Primary tagline:
“Verify the payment. Not just the screenshot.”

Alternative supporting headline:
“A screenshot isn't proof. Check the evidence.”

Product description:
ProofPay helps individuals and merchants analyze submitted payment screenshots, identify suspicious inconsistencies, flag duplicate or visually similar receipts, and compare receipt details against expected orders.

The current version is an evidence-analysis MVP. It does NOT independently confirm whether money has reached a bank account. Independent payment confirmation requires an authorized payment-provider integration.

Target users:
1. Individuals checking a screenshot they received.
2. Small businesses, Instagram sellers, freelancers, shopkeepers and merchants managing payment evidence and orders.

